      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/web_console/using-dashboard-to-get-cluster-information#using-dashboard-to-get-cluster-info">Viewing cluster information</a></li>
      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/web_console/configuring-web-console#configuring-web-console">Configuring the web console</a></li>
      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/web_console/customizing-the-web-console#customizing-web-console">Customizing the web console</a></li>
